      "body": "## Motivation\n\n#38437 updated the MemFabric-Hybrid version in the Ascend component table to `1.1.4`, but the source-install command below still uses `1.0.8`. Both CANN version tables on the page currently list `1.1.4`.\n\n## Modifications\n\nChange only the source-install command from `pip install memfabric-hybrid==1.0.8` to `pip install memfabric-hybrid==1.1.4`. No dependency files, Docker configuration, or other version pins are changed.\n\n## Validation\n\nPassed locally on base `937c0a6cfe97f50adc62beff9a9e156124a6367a`:\n\n- `pre-commit run --files docs/docs/hardware-platforms/ascend-npus/getting-started/installation.mdx --show-diff-on-failure`\n- Mintlify `4.2.559`: `mint broken-links --check-anchors --check-redirects`\n- MDX parsing of the changed page with `@mdx-js/mdx`\n- `git diff --check`, patch application, and assertions that the diff changes one line, all three MemFabric-Hybrid pins on the page are `1.1.4`, and no `1.0.8` remains in the file\n\n[PyPI release metadata](https://pypi.org/project/memfabric-hybrid/1.1.4/) confirms that `1.1.4` is not yanked and provides CPython 3.11/3.12 Linux wheels for x86_64 and aarch64. Package binaries were not downloaded or installed.\n\nFull `mint validate` could not start in this environment: Node's `os.networkInterfaces()` failed with `uv_interface_addresses returned Unknown system error 1`. The successful link and MDX checks do not replace full build validation. Whole-repository `pre-commit --all-files` was not run.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable to this documentation-only change. No NPU runtime or compatibility tests were performed; this aligns the command with the existing page, rather than claiming a new validated component stack.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable; no inference code changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Applicable changed-file pre-commit checks passed.\n- [x] Updated the installation documentation.\n- [x] Confirmed only the intended line changed.\n- [ ] Full Mintlify build validation (environment limitation described above).\n\n## AI assistance\n\nPrepared with AI assistance. The diff, repository version references, and reported validation results were checked before submission.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #37186976050](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37186976050)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37186975829](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37186975829)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
